<h4>Objectives</h4>
<ol>
<li>Learn all the intervals.</li>
<li>Learn the fretboard patterns for the intervals.</li>
<li>Learn both ways to play intervals.</li>
</ol>
<div align=3D"center"><video controls=3D"controls" width=3D"400" height=3D"=
