<h4>Intervals on the Fretboard</h4>
<p>The diagram below shows the intervals from the first fret.</p>
<p>Examples</p>
<ol>
<li>First fret to the second fret is a minor second (1 frets up).</li>
<li>First fret to the fifth fret is a major third (4 frets up).</li>
<li>First fret to the eleventh fret is a minor seventh (10 frets up).</li>
</ol>
